  (text "Keying and rear I/O -- PTT inputs, override / mute logic, rig DE-9 with protection, indicators, rear switches." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "220982ed-935d-52e5-be42-9facadbac1f8"))
  (text "PTT inputs: 3.5 mm + 1/4\" + front button per channel, contact closure to GND; bead, 10k pull-up at the jack node, then 1k + diode clamps to +9V/GND + 100n (keyers and computer interfaces may drive them)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b6c9bd5f-37bd-57e3-ba91-9ad36a3ece03"))
  (text "Logic (0/+9V, active high): PTT_x = keyed (2k2 pull-up, ~7.4 V loaded); PTT_ACTIVE = A or B (~6.8 V) -> 2N7002 open-drain to the rig, intercom lockout, TX lamp." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 26.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2b247551-4c2e-59df-ae8b-1733f32d56c7"))
  (text "OVERRIDE (DPDT on-off-on, top panel): A->B keys the rig from A and mutes B; B->A mirror. MUTE_x = latching button OR override OR (JP70x: not keyed) OR power-on hold. All logic transistors are 2N7002 so no base current loads the logic highs." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ed86686f-389e-5166-b9a0-69c775165d61"))
  (text "DE-9 (F): every line bead + 1n (10n on DC lines) at the pin, 15 V TVS (SMAJ15A unidirectional on the DC lines), 100R series -- survives accidental RS-232 hookups. Returns/shell to CHASSIS. LEDs from RAW_13V8 via droppers." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "44813752-bc4d-5ccb-8ebc-de4e9b228c24"))
  (text "PTT_x_N: low = keyed (raw input); PTT_x: high = keyed" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 43.18 44.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6dd3be09-9d79-59c9-839f-0ac9befffe9c"))
  (text "OVERRIDE (SW703, on-off-on): A->B / centre OFF / B->A as marked on the top panel" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 109.22 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8f29d48a-e850-5c78-ad0b-9de32e191970"))
  (text "JP701/JP702 (PTT GATE): mic live only while keyed" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 118.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c1c98c73-37d5-5217-86be-33f35b474e35"))
  (text "1 MIC, 6 PTT, 2 RX L, 7 RX R, 3 CW spare;" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 205.74 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "56be1ca4-93de-5ab9-a96e-bd951f3b528f"))
  (text "4/5/8/9 (cable returns) and shell -> CHASSIS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 205.74 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b0f28365-ade1-57a0-9009-1d8de2b11d8b"))
  (text "(solder-side view: signals left, grounds right)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 205.74 99.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2287d278-987b-5ff0-b33e-d2dcfd30a64f"))
  (text "NT701 = the single CHASSIS-GND tie; every sleeve /" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 205.74 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3cb49e0d-2eeb-589a-b205-8e4c72680bbc"))
  (text "TRRS ring 2 / DE-9 return lands on CHASSIS at entry." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 205.74 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ed96e5b6-557b-56ce-9764-02a56f63c6c6"))
  (text "INDICATORS: TX lamp (17 mA, prominent), per-channel PTT and MUTE, power. Intercom LED is on the TX Bus sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0dbde41a-c13b-5685-b025-e48f57f0bc21"))
  (text "All LEDs run from the raw filtered rail so their step loads never touch the +9V analog rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 187.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "32a5ec99-301d-59bf-81e3-39237f71bd12"))
  (text "REAR PANEL: gain range (LO/HI) and electret bias, per channel" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 185.42 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0b0e3f33-7af0-55fd-ae7f-56178291a390"))
  (text "Power-on hold: MUTE_A/B > 5 V for ~1 s (C710/R731, 1M loads);" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.25 158.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "83f724d2-30bc-51be-adf9-8410fdec04a8"))
  (text "D726 discharges C710 at power-off (quick re-arm)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.25 161.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1910914b-6d5e-5735-b52c-6f5eef7d08a5"))
